7️⃣ Create EKS Cluster (Example)

eksctl create cluster \
--name demo-eks \
--region ap-south-1 \
--nodegroup-name linux-nodes \
--node-type t3.medium \
--nodes 2

for check used this command "kubectl get nodes"
